WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Prepare for the Moon and Mars by asking what Earth can actually test.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.600
Compare landforms using NASA and ESA open data. Inspect source, units and uncertainty.

3
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:18.200
Mexico is our validated case study. Atacama, Arizona and Arabia: 3 of 10 prioritized arid regions.

4
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:24.900
Design a rover, test on Earth, then attempt a Moon or Mars delivery. Game balance is not field validation.

5
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:29.900
Earth cannot reproduce target gravity, lunar vacuum or radiation. Candidate sites need scientific review.
